{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1786659678745674001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"legged-tenuous-bonobo","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"f4324df437f467ac4f8a4a1b27c64b7562dbc49a106e2d27a1dbb48123dbf331","event_uuid":"72f19012-b56a-4cf4-9de0-5db3b7954e91","position":{"commit_sha":"7340cc3873498ecd1a316a6ca7a594e1ae57f4ff","position":"1786649288703967001-72f19012-b56a-4cf4-9de0-5db3b7954e91"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"eb890ee2f4cbb4e633728d177e2d3ccbb0e1b1bb091935f5c65142d3152ac5bb","event_uuid":"5f2539db-aa4f-487d-a8bf-295183818f29","position":{"commit_sha":"21525546d74d3a8fa44b3e197376fb0133b2b944","position":"1786649306216232001-5f2539db-aa4f-487d-a8bf-295183818f29"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1786649288703967001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"5f2539db-aa4f-487d-a8bf-295183818f29","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"06e0-fb68-657a-4ea1"}],"description":"## Context\nSplit out of 06e0-fb68-657a-4ea1 (effete-barbaric-xiaosaurus). `reducer` is ONE\nun-annotated def away from the tier-1 typing ratchet — but that one def is not a\nrubber-stamp annotation, which is why it was excluded rather than papered over.\n\n## The problem\n`rebar.reducer._filters.match_predicate(state, field, op, value)` takes `value` whose\ntype DEPENDS ON `op`: a scalar for `eq`/`lt`/`le`/`gt`/`ge`, an iterable for `in`, and a\n`(lo, hi)` pair for `range`. Annotating it `value: object` was tried and produces 7 real\nmypy errors in the body (`object` is not iterable, no `int()` overload, etc.).\n`value: Any` would satisfy the ratchet while buying neither the navigability nor the\ncontract driver — exactly the failure mode ticket cc77-8120-bcc6-47e8 documents.\n\n## Approach\nModel the predicate properly rather than widening: e.g. an operator-tagged predicate\nvalue (a small union / dataclass per operator family) built by the two callers\n(`reducer/_query.py` and `apply_ticket_filters`), so the operator and its value shape\ntravel together and the body narrows by construction. Then promote `rebar.reducer.*` into\nthe tier-1 override in pyproject.toml and `_RATCHET_BASELINE` in\ntests/unit/test_mypy_ratchet.py.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] `mypy src/rebar/reducer --disallow-untyped-defs` is clean with NO new `: Any`/`-> Any`.\n- [ ] `rebar.reducer.*` is in the tier-1 override and pinned in `_RATCHET_BASELINE`.\n- [ ] Filter/query behaviour is unchanged (existing reducer filter tests pass unmodified).","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"d893-e003-0539-47fc","ticket_type":"task","title":"Give reducer._filters.match_predicate a typed predicate value so reducer can join the typing ratchet","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["72f19012-b56a-4cf4-9de0-5db3b7954e91","5f2539db-aa4f-487d-a8bf-295183818f29"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1786659678745674001,"uuid":"6115273c-ca00-4bc2-9a9e-c5931d5304f7"}